# Forms

- React Hook Form + Zod resolver.
- Reuse the same Zod schema on the server action.
- Show field-level errors; disable double-submit on post actions.
- Money and qty inputs: controlled formatting; parse to decimal-safe values.
- Confirm dialogs before void/post when irreversible.
